{"title":"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2><p>\nFind the number of ordered pairs of positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/faedb9d30dc3763d92cbcacf2cc17e2bf64f3e8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c,d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" /> that satisfy the following equation:</p><center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/6/ce6136616ccd8c46acf5b3c5add0fcd7203037b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c+d=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"143\" height=\"14\" />.</center>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Generating_function\" title=\"Generating function\">generating function</a> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/0/2d02bb2275100261109b043261e702124460a83e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/b/bbb3690943e9be010c35aba038402827ca4b27bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+x^2+x^3+\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/6/af6b10a5b30af6b204cdd1721e90475bf7fec437.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+x^2+x^3+\\cdots)^4=x^4(1+x+x^2+x^3)^4= x^4+{4\\choose 3}x^5+{5\\choose 3}x^6+\\cdots\\]\" width=\"537\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>The coefficient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/6/2861637af5302d7734ffcb197e2ec9072d197db7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{12}$\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/0/cc033761893c4ad57bccfd00a710084903fce452.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{3+12-4}{3}=165$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"159\" height=\"53\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We consider a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Bijection\" title=\"Bijection\">bijection</a> to the following combinatorial argument. Suppose we have twelve balls and we would like to put them into four urns. There is a positive number of balls in each urn, so we put one ball into each urn initially. We are left with eight balls to go into four urns, which is equivalent to have three dividers. Thus there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/6/fd6cfacb4baebf26618b5deba321aae7f5ffc6f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{11!}{8!3!} = 165$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"83\" height=\"38\" /> ordered pairs.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST\">2005 Alabama ARML TST</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<center><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 9\">A similar problem</a></center>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017205147\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 115/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1384/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 217/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1664/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.823      1 Template:ARML_box\n100.00%    6.823      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6164:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017205147 and revision id 26659. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}